VGAE baseline: TRAINED 2-layer GCN encoder (Kipf & Welling 2016), inner-product
decoder, Adam optimizer, 200 epochs, weighted BCE + KL loss (standard VGAE objective).
mu at inference, L2-row-normalized, + FuzzyCMeans(m=1.5) clustering. k = ground-truth count.
